window.products.push({"id":553091,"name":"Globe and Anchor Metal Sign 19\" x 19\" for USMC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dgfK4J-3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"19\" x 19\" USMC OFFICER GLOBE AND ANCHOR (EGA) METAL SIGN. 14 Gauge Flat Metal Sign. Nice item to put up outside or inside. Officially Licensed. Because we use a highly detail digital picture all details of the emblem is captured, this includes the glare from the chrome and imperfections in the casting of some emblems. We believe this is what gives our signs that unique look and feel. Looks 3D, but this is a FLAT metal sign.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dgfK4J-3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PhotoSteel","source_asin":"B01L9RJ0J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L9RJ0J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L9RJ0J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":553092,"name":"Grocery Bags Reusable Shopping Bags Extra Large Folding Bags Totes Sturdy and Lightweight","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyMXmWEEL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester Fabric Polyester lining Zipper closure Machine Wash EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY: Extra Large reusable grocery bags can hold over 60 Lbs or 2-3 plastic grocery bags of stuffs. These shopping bags are made of rip-stop polyester fabric which is lightweight and sturdy and it makes our reusable bags strong enough to pack heavy groceries, like canned goods, gallons of milk.The long strap allows you to carry it on shoulder or by hand, which makes carrying them into the house from the car much easier. RIP-STOP FABRIC & WATERPROOF:The reusable grocery tote bag is made of rip-stop Polyester fabric (with water resistant coating) The seams are thickened, which is thick and firm.The large grocery shopping bag is strong and durable and can hold up to 60 lbs. FASHION CLASSIC PATTERN & EASY TO CARRY AROUND: These reusable shopping bags have 6 fashionable pattern: zebra print, pink camouflage, leopard print, coffee camouflage, black leopard grain and dark blue. They are cute grocery reusable bags. These reusable grocery bags can be easily folded into the attached pocket-size pouch, so you can carry these foldable grocery bags in your purse or car without taking up too much space. MACHINE WASHABLE: Being washable is a must for any reusable bags. Our reusable shopping bags are Machine Washable! Toss them right into the machine washer to save your time! You can help to reduce your impact on the environment by using reusable bags. REUSABLE & ECO FRIENDLY: One reusable shopping bag is equivalent to 1000+ times of using plastic disposal bags. A great alternative to single-use plastic bags, which are often not recycled, and frequently pollute waterways and other public areas. Choose a fashionable and eco-friendly way to protect our Earth. Keep folded shopping bags in your handbag and car for emergencies or outdoor activities. By reusing reusable grocery bags heavy duty & keeping plastic out of landfills & oceans!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyMXmWEEL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VLANCH","source_asin":"B08PKBT39J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PKBT39J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PKBT39J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
