window.products.push({"id":553102,"name":"HomeMall Electric Mini Garlic Chopper, Portable Mini Chopper Food Processor, Blender Mincer Waterproof USB Charging for Ginger Onion Vegetable Meat Nu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l-LLtBaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥕【Two choices for one product】Package come with 1*motor head, 1*250ML cup, 1*100ML cup, 2*blades, 1* USB cable, 1* user manual. Meat and vegetables can be minced in different cups, which is safer and hygienic.The mini chopper helps you do small, quick jobs such as chopping garlic, ginger, peppers, carrots, vegetables, onions, nuts and more. 🍄【USB Charging】: It can be used for up to 1 month just by charging it for 3 hours using the USB charging method. The garlic onion chopper can be used up to 50 times when fully charged. Since the charging cable can be removed and it is compact, it is extremely storable. And don't worry, the USB charging port is also waterproof, which makes it easy to carry and suitable for family, camping, picnic and travel. 🌶【Easy To Use and Clean】One touch button to switch the chopper on or off , just fill the container with your ingredients, lock the cover, you can get an evenly shred food in a few seconds. The whole body of the crusher is waterproof and the blades are removable. You can directly rinse the food chopper after use, which is easy cleaning with no residue. 🥦【Food Grade Safe Material】The mini chopper is made of high-quality ABS, PP and PC materials, food-grade cup body, harmless to people, safe for containing food. The cutter head is made of high-quality 304 stainless steel with a 45-degree angle design for better chopping and blending., which is hard, food-grade, safe, high temperature resistant and corrosion resistant. 🧄【Tips for use】It is recommended that you cut large pieces of food into small pieces before use. Don't pile up the bottom space. For vegetables/fruits with hard skin, peel it off first. For hard roots such as carrots, beetroots, celeries, etc. make sure to PREBOIL them or MICROWAVE them quickly first before chopping them using the chopper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l-LLtBaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMall","source_asin":"B08XJY4THG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XJY4THG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XJY4THG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
