window.products.push({"id":553250,"name":"Wine Stoppers Lxuzan Chinese Metal Zodiac Wine Bottle Stoppers New Combined Effectively Extended Storage Time(Rat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iYEzS2EKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description ▷ The air will let the wine breathe, so it will be more delicious, it is the pleasure of tasting wine. But the air also makes the wine taste bad in a short period of time.▷ Our products can effectively extend this delicious period of time. Each product is very beautiful, it is a good gift, exquisite and practical. You can give it to someone you like. ▷ You can use warm water to clean all these wine plugs.advise don't use the dishwasher. Pack Listing 1x Vacuum Stopper.1x Silicone Stopper.3x China Zodiac Stopper. Product Attribute Vacuum China-Zodiac Wine Stoppers ☆ China-Zodiac is very easy to use,just tight the plugs into bottle. ☆ The vacuum plug storage effect is the best in all kinds of wine stoppers.latest vacuum plug is better than the previous material, with longer storage time, better workmanship careful and larger exhaust volume. ☆ Freshness time is about 14 days, (if you did a special way, the time will be more longer). ☆ It's suitable for family, bar, dance, celebration and other occasions, noble and elegant. is the best choice for wine and gift. Description of Use of the Vacuum Wine Stoppers Insert the plug tightly into the bottle, and when you gently lift the pump rod, it feels like a force is stopping you and the pump rod returns automatically. That's the proof that the wine bottle air inside is close to the vacuum. Remind ♥ People have different opinions about how to identify the deterioration of wine, and what consumers should pay attention to is that the wine storage time is too long does not mean drinking the wine will cause discomfort to the body.♥ Just the taste will be somewhat unpleasant or sour, so if it’s not sure whether the bottle of wine can be able to drink, you can taste a little. If you like, go on with it. If you don't like it, you can make it coexist with garbage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iYEzS2EKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lxuzan","source_asin":"B07HBYN1NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HBYN1NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HBYN1NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
