window.products.push({"id":553363,"name":"Maverton Refillable Photo Album for children - Photo book with overprint for boy- Photo storage for kids - Black pages - Customized album for First Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LIuUr7-zS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎁UNIQUE PHOTO ALBUM Keep precious memories from every big day in one special book. The album measures 13 x 11.8 inches and you can paste there different size photos including: 3.9 x 5.9 inches, 5.1 x 7 inches and 5.9 x 8.3 inches format. The total of 60 pages can hold up to 240 pictures. Sturdy binding and thick leather cover allow long-term storage of your beautiful moments. 🎈FOR CHILDREN The visual elegance of the memory book makes it a stunning gift choice for a boy or a girl. This unique and sophisticated album is an extraordinary and original gift to celebrate and commemorate Holy Communion. Perfect place to keep and display all your precious memories of the important religious event in the child’s life. You can also add a personalized message on the front page with whatever expression you want. Add a personal touch to the gift. 🔬UNIQUE PERSONALIZATION To make your choice one-of-a kind gift idea, you can request a special message to be overprinted in a lovely font to create a beautiful bespoke gift, ideal for various occasions! To customize your item, click on ‘’customize now’’ button on the right side of the page where you can choose from different personalized quotes, wishes and templates. 💎STYLISH The memory book of a unique, appealing design with kiddie patterns on the cover allows you to keep track of the important stages of a baby’s life in the most adorable way. Create a highly personalized, colorful book of your child’s lovely moments. Get inspired by our collection of different styles and find the one that perfectly represents your child. The journal will definitely become a cherished present once it is filled with pictures from every special moment. 👍PRACTICAL The photo album is designed to display and protect up to 240 pictures in multiple sizes. Easy to glue: 240 pictures of 3.9 x 5.9 inches, 120 pictures of 5 x 7 inches and 120 pictures of 5.9 x 8.2 inches. Thick, black pages with transparent dividers offer safe and dust-free storage. The scrapbook is carefully sewn to protect your prints and to prevent pages from sticking together. A beautiful memory book to capture all of your precious moments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LIuUr7-zS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverton","source_asin":"B09TPJB7D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TPJB7D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TPJB7D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
