window.products.push({"id":553387,"name":"Thermos Stainless Steel King 40 Ounce Beverage Bottle, Slate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WmcHl7tiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An ideal choice for people on the go, the THERMOS Stainless King Vacuum Insulated Beverage Bottle is built to last and loaded with features to make for a more enjoyable drinking experience. THERMOS vacuum insulation technology virtually eliminates temperature change within the beverage container by creating an airless space between two stainless steel walls. The result is an insulation layer that performs better than any other. A superior insulated container you can depend on to keep your beverages hotter, colder, fresher, longer. This beverage bottle keeps beverages hot or cold for 24 hours, making it a great choice for wherever life's adventures may take you. Constructed with double wall stainless steel, this 40 ounce beverage bottle is durable, yet its sleek design is both eye-catching and functional. The specially designed twist and pour stopper lets you pour without having to remove the stopper completely. A simple twist is enough to allow liquids to flow out. This beverage bottle comes equipped with its own built-in, insulated stainless steel serving cup, so there is no need to pack an additional cup. The bottle also features a compact, fold-flat handle for easy carrying that also provides increased stability and handling when pouring. Top of the line construction and rubber gaskets keep this bottle leak-proof and because of the double wall insulation, the stainless steel body stays cool to the touch with hot beverages and condensation-free with cold beverages. In order to maximize the incredible insulation technology, it is recommended to either pre-chill or pre-heat the beverage bottle just prior to use. This can be accomplished by filling the beverage bottle with cold or hot tap water, attaching the lid and letting it rest for a few minutes. Before you are ready to use, simply empty the water and fill with your favorite beverage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WmcHl7tiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B0C48KPMFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C48KPMFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C48KPMFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":553388,"name":"Mistifi Glass Oil Sprayer/Mister 5.1 fl oz (150ml), For Cooking Oil, Olive Oil, Soy Sauce, Vinegar, Non-Aerosol Refillable Dispenser, Spray Bottle (FS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mA6dPFSkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mistifi Oil Sprayer uses the most advanced international patented pre-compression spray technology, which can atomize your favorite cooking oil, bring an excellent cooking experience, and develop a low-oil diet life style. It’s an easy-to-use refillable dispenser without gas inside, and no complicated pressurization operation before spraying. The ergonomic arc design that combines aesthetics and functionality makes the sprayer easier to use. Even users with small hands can operate the sprayer conveniently with the perfect lever angle. The proper trigger force makes your fingers not feel tired even after a long-time use of the spray bottle. The dispense head is made of plastic (majority polyolefins (PP, PE) + (1) stainless steel spring) and the bottle material is glass, both are available with FDA certifications. The distance to the pan can be adjusted to control the covered area when spraying. Three spray modes by trigger techniques1. Half stroke Pull: for small areas use, it can effectively reduce the consumption of cooking oil 2. Full Stroke Pull: move the wrist when spraying fan-shaped mist, the oil can be evenly covered on the target area 3. Continuous Spray: spray your favorite oil on the large area effectively and evenly, ideal for BBQ While reducing the intake of oil, Mistifi Oil Sprayer also brings the joy of cooking, which is a kitchen artifact that many healthy dieters love.You can spray not only cooking oil, but also vinegar, soy sauce and cooking wine. PRECAUTIONS & TIPS1. PRIMING: pull the trigger completely 5-10 times to start spraying. Once primed, no need for re-priming2. DO NOT use it for liquids with particles3. If you have filled other liquids before, clean and dry the spray bottle before using the new liquid","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mA6dPFSkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mistifi","source_asin":"B095BXYV73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095BXYV73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095BXYV73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
