window.products.push({"id":553470,"name":"VIGBOAT Travel Neck Pillow, Memory Foam Travel Pillows for Sleeping Airplane, Ergonomic Traveling Essentials for Adult, Neck and Chin Support Pillow f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L4Ky-IPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✈️ SIZE: Average, suitable for neck circumference 12-15.5inches, both for adult men and women. ✈️ MAXIMUM COMFORT: With high standard slow-resilience technology, VIGBOAT memory foam travel pillow can gently adjust its shape to closely fit your neck with the largest contact area. Your neck pressure will be evenly dispersed and every movement of you will be gently supported. ✈️ DOUBLE-SIDE ERGONOMIC SUPPORT: VIGBOAT neck support pillow contours to your head, neck and chin to provide real snug support from above. From bottom, it is also contoured to allow to sit on the shoulders for better suppport. The clasp at the front allows to adjust and tighten the neck pillow enough to prevent head from falling forward. No more kinks! ✈️ BREATHABLE & SKIN-FRIENDLY: The inner fabric of the neck pillows cover is mainly made of cotton (75%), features great moisture absorption and breathability. The outer is wrap knitting velvet, super soft and smooth. The pillowcase is machine washable, for you to get a fresh clean neck travel pillow in each journey. ✈️ MAXIMUM PORTABILITY: VIGBOAT neck pillows for travel adopts the unique 1+1/2 sets of clasp design. Just roll up the pillow, tighten it easily with the spare 1/2 set, and stow away in the pouch or your backpack in seconds, taking up the least space possible. ✈️ WIDE APPLICATION: A cozy neck support travel pillow is a necessity for our everyday life. Whether travelling on an airplane ride, train trip, van life, car driving, working in the office, napping in the chair, sitting at a desk, or watching TV in a recliner, VIGBOAT ergonomic travel pillow for neck support will help keep your neck in a right position with snug comfort. It takes pressure off, helps pain go away and protect the health of our neck, spine etc. Buy for you and your loved ones!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L4Ky-IPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIGBOAT","source_asin":"B0C6QRJKNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6QRJKNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6QRJKNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
