window.products.push({"id":553717,"name":"Yoshihiro Hongasumi Blue Steel Edo Usuba Traditional Japanese Vegetable Chopping Chef Knife (7'' (180mm), Rosewood Handle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DU4kheMAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Knife Features → Blade Material: Blue Steel #2  →Edge Angle: Single Edged  →Grade: Hongasumi  →Handle Shape: Octagonal  →HRC:63-64  →Knife Style: Usuba Vegetable Knife  →Stain Resistant: No  →Saya Cover: Magnolia Saya Cover  Our handmade Yoshihiro Hongasumi knives are crafted with extraordinary skill by our master artisans to create high quality knives that are indispensable in their craftsmanship and performance. Blue Steel #2 with a hardness on the Rockwell scale of 63 to 64, is forged with iron to create beautiful mist patterns, and an emphasis is placed on refined forging and polishing with the highest attention to detail. Handcrafted in Japan with traditional techniques, our Usuba has a completely flat grind on the front side (Shinogi), a concave grind (Urasuki), and a flat rim (Uraoshi) on the back. The combination of the Urasuki and Shinogi allow for the blade to cut food with minimal damage to the surface and cells, therefore not spoiling the texture and taste. The Uraoshi is the thin, flat rim that surrounds the Urasuki and enhances the strength of the blade at its otherwise vulnerable edges.Proudly made in Japan and not mass produced. This knife is complimented with a traditional Japanese Wa-style handcrafted Octagonal Handle that is lightweight and ergonomically welds to the hand for seamless use. A protective wooden sheath called a Saya is included, which protects the knife and adds to its appearance when not in use. TTraditional Japanese knife making values a sharp edge, which requires attention and care. Sharpening and honing should be done with only water whetstones. Hand wash and dry only, and do so immediately if working with acidic ingredients. Do not use on objects such as bones, nutshells, and frozen foods. Carbon steel can oxidize if not properly maintained. Keep dry and oil regularly to prevent oxidation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DU4kheMAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B085RKK895","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085RKK895","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085RKK895","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":553718,"name":"SIGOODS 4 Piece Bed Sheets Set, Microfiber 1800 Bedding Sheets & Pillowcases, 16 Inch Deep Pocket Bed Sheets Set, Super Soft Hypoallergenic Breathable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QZEJSWMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Queen Size Sheet Set】: Include 4 pieces - 1 flat sheet (102\"x99\"), 1 fitted sheet (80\"x60\") fits the mattress up to 16 inch deep pocket, and 2 pillowcase (20\"x30\"). Various colors of the bed sheets and pillowcases, not only make you feel more relax and comfortable, but also match a variety of decoration styles. 【Luxury Microfiber Bedding Sheets & Pillowcases】: Woven with exquisite 1800 thread count high-quality microfiber fabric, the bed sheets present the ultra-softness to soothe you to sleep. Whether for bedroom, guest room, or RV, the bed sheets set can always decorate your room with beauty and comfort. 【Easy Care】: SIGOODS premium bed sheets set are resistant to fading, staining, shrinking, and wrinkles! They are machine washable in cold water and dry quickly on tumble! They are more durable than cotton sheets. Plus, they’re hypoallergenic. 【Comfortable Experience】: SIGOODS sheets set has a lightweight and breathable structure, providing unparalleled comfort! The exquisite design perfectly combines durability and softness. Makes you warm and comfortable in winter and cool in summer. The queen size sheets set will provide you and your family with a comfortable sleep experience in a five-star hotel. 【PERFECT GIFT IDEA】: These deep pocket queen sheet sets are a beautiful addition to any bedroom. Friends, family, loved ones can use this product in any room of choosing, master bedroom, guest room, vacation home or anywhere else! A perfect gift for any occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QZEJSWMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIGOODS","source_asin":"B08YDPPN5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDPPN5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDPPN5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":553719,"name":"Carlisle FoodService Products KL11805 Kingline Melamine Nappie Bowl, 9.3 oz. Capacity, 5.12 x 1.65\", Red (Case of 48)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":111.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619qR26mbAL._AC_SL1157_.jpg","description":"This Carlisle KL11805 Kingline 9.3 oz. red nappie bowl is a stackable bowl for home and commercial food service use. It is made of melamine resin for durability and resistance to stains, scratches, and breaking. This bowl is suitable for temperatures up to 212 degrees F, dishwasher-safe, and free of BPA (Bisphenol A) to address food safety concerns raised by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) and other organizations. It meets NSF International standards for use in food handling and processing, and National Institute of Standards. This bowl measures 1.65\" high and 5.1\" in diameter. Carlisle manufactures food service equipment and supplies and sanitary maintenance tools and supplies for commercial, industrial, and institutional facilities. The company, founded in 1954, is headquartered in Oklahoma City, OK.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619qR26mbAL._AC_SL1157_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carlisle FoodService Products","source_asin":"B00ZRQ5GIS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZRQ5GIS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZRQ5GIS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false})