window.products.push({"id":553758,"name":"Pre Filter and Post Motor HEPA Filter Replacements for Dyson DC25 - Includes Bonus E-Book - Replaces Parts 919171-02 and 916188-06 - Combo Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RLBMqSn1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Cleaning your home is no more a hard task when you own a Dyson Vacuum Cleaner. The filtration system of any Dyson Vacuum Cleaner plays a vital role in proper functioning of the vacuum cleaner. The pre filter acts as a protection to the cyclone system. If this filter gets too congested, the vacuum cleaner will not run properly and could damage interior components. Also, the post filter is located after the motor and traps the fine particles before the air is expelled back out into the room. Over time, these filters can deteriorate and need to be replaced. And if you feel the suction has reduced, then it is the best time to replace your filter. But if you choose Dyson OEM Filters they will cost you more. Don't worry! The solution is here! Introducing PRE AND POST AIR FILTER REPLACEMENT KIT FOR DYSON! Our filter replacements replace parts 919171-02 and 916188-06 and are compatible with all DC25 models: DC25 All Floors DC25 AnimalDC25 Animal PlusDC25 Animal Total Clean DC25 Ball DC25 Blueprint DC25 Exclusive DC25 Multi FloorDC25 Multi Floor Exclusive This is not a Dyson OEM product. The Dyson brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Dyson brand names or model designations for this product are made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. Packaging May Vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RLBMqSn1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProParz","source_asin":"B07NS3J9X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NS3J9X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NS3J9X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
