window.products.push({"id":553818,"name":"Giantex 36 Bottle Modular Wine Rack, 6 Tier Wine Display Shelves, Stackable Free Standing Wine Bottles Organizer for Bar, Cellar, Cabinet, Pantry, No ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7139r+2mXTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"〖Wine Rack for 36 Bottles〗: 🍷If you only have the Claret style bottle, this would be the perfect wine rack for you. It is very sturdy and not too hard to put together.🍷 The wine rack offers you with a perfect wine storage solution and saves your home, bar, wine cellar, kitchen and basement space. The wine display rack coming with 6 rows, each of which holds 6 bottles, can hold up to 36 bottles of red wine. The arc-shaped design with small notch makes the bottle fit perfectly. 〖Keep Liquor Taste Mellow〗: If the wine bottle is placed vertically, the cork will become so dry that air will enter the bottle and cause premature oxidation of red wine. The horizontal design with a little inclination of our wine rack can keep the cork moist and ensure the palate of red wine is lush. 〖Wobble-Free Guarantee〗: With dowel to interlock each joint, the sturdy construction prevents shelf from wobbling and shaking, which keeps bottles stable. The bottle display standing shelf is easy to assemble with no hardware or tools necessary, so that it can be placed either side by side, stacked on top of each other, or placed separately according to your own needs. 〖High Quality Pine Material〗: On the one hand, using mortise and tenon structure technology, our pine wine rack is very environmentally friendly. Besides, it is difficult to deform and crack. On the other hand, pine wood material has natural beauty and clear wood grain. In addition, the surface is very smooth. 〖Multi-Scene Application〗: Due to its natural and beautiful appearance, our 6-tier wine rack, as an additional decoration, is suitable for any decor. You can place it at home, kitchen, pantry, cabinet, dining room, basement, bar, wine cellar and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7139r+2mXTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B08126SDM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08126SDM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08126SDM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
