window.products.push({"id":553897,"name":"SUPERIOR Cotton Blend 600 Thread Count Sheet Set, Polka Dot Design, Includes 1 Elastic Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet, 1 Flat Sheet, 2 Pillowcases, Luxury B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wyQdP-kwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"***Impressions is now Superior brand*** Affordable Luxury Linens Give your bed a stylish look and a trendy new layer of comfort with this 600 thread count cotton blend sheet set. This bedding is cozy and warm in winter and is equally comfortable in summer, thanks to the breathable cotton. The added polyester microfiber makes these sheets more wrinkle resistant than standard cotton, and they feature a luxurious sateen weave for a subtle sheen and a buttery soft feel. Available in a variety of sizes and 8 bright and bold colors, these polka dot sheet sets are perfect to give a fresh and fun look to a college dorm room, a charming master bedroom, a cheerful guest room, or a bright kid’s room. The fully elasticized fitted sheet fits snugly on most mattresses 6” to 18\" thick, and the pillowcases and flat sheets boast a classic 4\" hem for a neat, polished look.  This high-quality sheet set is naturally wrinkle resistant and requires little or no ironing when removed promptly from dryer. The \"cool\" sensation and smooth texture are comfortable and relaxing, and the fresh, rich solid colors will look beautiful in any room. These bed linens are machine washable, colorfast and wear extremely well. For drying, tumble dry low and remove promptly from dryer. Always follow care label instructions for best results. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: “I love love love these sheets. Soft and luxurious” “Love the softness. Bought two sets. Never has such soft sheets before!!!” “These sheets are a thick material and after many washes, the color is still bright and cheery!” “These sheets are super cute! The color is very bright and the sheets feel very soft. I couldn't be happier with this purchase<3” “These are the best sheets. The white and black color is so beautiful - crisp, bright & solid. Feels like your sleeping in a fluffy cloud. So glad ordered them - I would definitely order these sheets again... if you order them - you won't be disappointed” “I'm always cold, and he's always hot, but these are perfect” And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wyQdP-kwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B07B7WX6KJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B7WX6KJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B7WX6KJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
