window.products.push({"id":553986,"name":"TISHIJIE Folding Space Heaters Electric Foot Warmer with Tip-Over 45°Angle Auto-Off and Overheat Protection - for Home, Office Desk, Bedroom Etc. (Gra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ul4lVgOXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SAFE TO USE 】: The surface is waterproof, splashing liquid will not cause short circuit, so it is safe to use it in contact with human body, and will not get electric shock or burn. In addition, it also has a heater with overheating protection function. When dumped at 45 degrees or continuously working for 3 hours, it will automatically turn off the power. [TEMPERATURE ADJUSTMENT AND RAPID HEATING] The temperature range from 85°F to 145°F is for you to choose, which can meet the needs of different people for different temperatures in different environments. It is a material with excellent heating characteristics, and it can quickly heat up after about 30 seconds after turn it on 【EASY TO USE】The heater features are the four-sided heating. Long press switch for 2 seconds to turn on or off. Tap to set the timing, from 1-12 hours. After 3 hours, the heater will auto-off by default. The default temperature is 115℉. The power cord is 1.9M long. 【COMFORTABLE & ENERGY SAVING】: With high-quality heating materials of carbon crystal heating film, it is quiet and no noise, you will not feel dry not like air conditioner. It does not produce glare light, fire or wind, can be used safely for babies and pets in the living room. Our space heaters power is only 200W, which is much lower than that of similar heaters. The design of the cover on the top make the product a relatively closed space, effectively avoiding heat dissipation. 【FOLDABLE PORTABLE DESIGN】: This product is lightweight and foldable, which can carry with you to anywhere and easy to store. It is convenient for you to use in offices, dining rooms, living rooms, study rooms, bedrooms, and hotels on business trips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ul4lVgOXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TISHIJIE","source_asin":"B08GK7VG7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-553986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GK7VG7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GK7VG7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
